{:spec/title "Migrate workflow runner-events println calls to structured logging"

 :spec/description
 "The workflow event-publishing helpers
  (components/workflow/src/ai/miniforge/workflow/runner_events.clj) use bare
  `println` for their error-path warnings. There are 9, each inside a
  `catch Exception` handler, and each already routes its text through the
  localized message catalog via `(messages/t :warn/... {...})`. They print to
  stdout instead of the structured logging component
  (ai.miniforge.logging.interface), so they never reach the event stream or
  the TUI dashboard.

  runner_events.clj does not yet require the logging interface and has no
  logger instance. runner.clj (the sibling it was extracted from) already
  holds a module-level logger:
    (defonce ^:private runner-logger
      (log/create-logger {:min-level :debug :output :human}))
  and calls e.g. (log/warn runner-logger :system :workflow/execution-stopped {...}).
  Mirror that: add the require and a module-level logger, then replace each
  `(println (messages/t :warn/x {...}))` with
  `(log/warn <logger> :workflow :warn/x {...})`, keeping the same message key
  and data map."

 :spec/intent {:type :refactor
               :scope ["components/workflow/src/ai/miniforge/workflow/runner_events.clj"]}

 :spec/constraints
 ["Only modify runner_events.clj"
  "Add (require [ai.miniforge.logging.interface :as log]) and a module-level logger mirroring runner.clj's runner-logger"
  "All 9 println calls are warn-level (error-path catch handlers) — use log/warn; there are no debug-level candidates in this file"
  "Preserve the existing (messages/t :warn/...) message keys and the {:error (ex-message e)} data; only the sink changes (println -> log/warn)"
  "Use the :workflow category keyword for every log/warn call"
  "Preserve existing error-handling behavior — the catch handlers must still swallow the exception (logging replaces printing, nothing more)"
  "All existing tests must continue to pass without modification"]

 :spec/acceptance-criteria
 ["No println calls remain in runner_events.clj"
  "All 9 former println sites use log/warn with the :workflow category and their original :warn/... message key + data"
  "runner_events.clj requires ai.miniforge.logging.interface and defines a module-level logger"
  "Existing workflow tests pass without modification"]

 :spec/workflow-type :canonical-sdlc}
